OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'beloved' 9-year-
OL,4,Cold girl as man due in court over death
OL,6,FThe family of nine-year-old Minnie
OL,7,FMerriman, who died after she was found
OL,8,Fseriously injured at an industrial
OL,9,Festate while her family were camping
OL,10,Fin Arbroath, have described her as
OL,11,F"beloved, absolutely incredible and
OL,12,Fbeautiful".
OL,14,FThe child, from West Yorkshire, was
OL,15,Ffound just after midnight on Monday at
OL,16,Fthe Elliot industrial estate in the
OL,17,FAngus town and taken to Ninewells
OL,18,FHospital in Dundee, where she later
OL,19,Fdied.
OL,26,@sD@AOUtD@JO]
