PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786011494
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to 'beloved' 9-year-
OL,4,Cold girl as man due in court over death
OL,6,FDetective inspector Mike Ness of
OL,7,FPolice Scotland's major investigation
OL,8,Fteam said a police presence will
OL,9,Fremain in the area while inquiries
OL,10,Fcontinue.
OL,12,FIn a statement released via Police
OL,13,FScotland her family said: "We are
OL,14,Fdevastated with the loss of our
OL,15,Fbeloved, absolutely incredible,
OL,16,Fbeautiful and brave Minnie Moo.
OL,18,F"Our family asks that our privacy is
OL,19,Frespected at this extremely difficult
OL,20,Ftime."
